","t":"得阿那含果蓋阿那含名為不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0048a01","n":"0048a","t":"此釋成上無說無得義上云無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0049a01","n":"0049a","t":"住二方便有餘淨土二乘所居"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0053a01","n":"0053a","t":"是名為諸佛若此經任在何處"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0054a01","n":"0054a","t":"上明假名無實心行處滅世尊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0056a01","n":"0056a","t":"草木花葉即是自己自己即是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0058a01","n":"0058a","t":"一希有何以故此人已通達勝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0059a01","n":"0059a","t":"此段前補明他悟後明忍辱為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0060a01","n":"0060a","t":"人為人損害我不特無瞋恨心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0061a01","n":"0061a","t":"故如來說一切諸相即是非相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0062a01","n":"0062a","t":"上已明無住修行之益此明菩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0063a01","n":"0063a","t":"比較聞此經典信心不逆所得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0065a01","n":"0065a","t":"根雖有或貪求世間富貴壽考"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0066a01","n":"0066a","t":"自有人的範圍不能飛空亦不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0067a01","n":"0067a","t":"德是無為無所得之功德能速"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0070a01","n":"0070a","t":"以實無有法得菩提則無我見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0071a01","n":"0071a","t":"具一切功德者為眾生歎美其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0072a01","n":"0072a","t":"然常寂則名真是菩薩等於佛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0073a01","n":"0073a","t":"凡夫眼範圍最小以紙障之即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0075a01","n":"0075a","t":"等故問須菩提云若有人滿三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0078a01","n":"0078a","t":"地之眾生莫不具金剛般若無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0079a01","n":"0079a","t":"至無有少法可得即是名為阿"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0080a01","n":"0080a","t":"之受持此般若波羅密經乃至"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0081a01","n":"0081a","t":"施之福德也此明如來化度眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0087a01","n":"0087a","t":"一合相者亦屬假名謂微塵眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0088a01","n":"0088a","t":"此明生知見亦是貪著凡夫之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0089a01","n":"0089a","t":"可得故云即非法相是假名法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0090a01","n":"0090a","t":"也如幻師為幻事然幻現種種"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-太虛-第五編-金剛般若波羅蜜經義脈","source":"CBETA TX06n0005 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":580,"unit":"TX6 頁欄"}